From 0954ed3b90232191a7f9bdac47dbc5294bbead6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 16:38:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ADD terminal visual selection so focused panes can be
 yanked

Terminal visual mode keeps cursor-backed selections scoped to the focused pane, renders the selected range, and yanks through the terminal clipboard path so users can copy left-pane or chat text without leaving Work Leaf.
